cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TritLogic in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "TritLogic — a balanced-ternary logic & circuit simulator"
abstract: >-
  An in-browser simulator for balanced-ternary ({-1, 0, +1}) digital logic:
  gates, arithmetic, memory, a microcoded CPU, tri-state buses, a two-level
  (MAX-of-MIN) logic minimizer, and timing/hazard analysis — all at the
  idealised-trit (switch/gate) level.
type: software
authors:
